156
00:09:01,319 --> 00:09:02,839
Because I have friends now.

157
00:09:05,739 --> 00:09:06,899
Come on, everybody.

158
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:09,439
Life's a lot more fun when you're dancing to the music.

159
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,199
Hey, that's pretty catchy.

160
00:09:11,739 --> 00:09:13,059
Yeah, he rocks.

161
