you're bound to be a wild.

163
00:09:31,719 --> 00:09:35,439
Meanwhile, near the giant bridge in the East Blue.

164
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:40,159
So you want to come to Baltigo with us after all?

165
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:41,879
What made you change your mind?

166
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:45,139
Well, whatever the reason, we're glad you did.

167
00:09:45,659 --> 00:09:47,759
Dragon's been eager to meet you for a long time.

168
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:52,039
If I'd known the revolutionaries were so nice,

169
00:09:52,219 --> 00:09:54,499
